{"id":"ac4cbbb5670d2ea7","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Essential Infimum","display":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum — ZFC Measure4 Essential Infimum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum","58-df-zfc-measure7-essential-infimum"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum — ZFC Measure4 Essential Infimum","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[58-df-order]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-essential-infimum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-infimum — ZFC Measure4 Essential Infimum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (measure-space carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (measurable sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\Sigma\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\mu:\\Sigma\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:X\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> (measurable real-valued function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in[-\\infty,\\infty]\">\\(a\\in[-\\infty,\\infty]\\)</span> (extended-real essential infimum value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialInfimum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialInfimum}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in[-\\infty,\\infty]\">\\(r\\in[-\\infty,\\infty]\\)</span> (merged essential-infimum value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (merged sigma algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> (real bound used in the canonical assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S,\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S,\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span> (source predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EssentialInfimum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EssentialInfimum}_S\\)</span> (merged predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}infimum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialInfimum}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\Sigma)\\land a\\in[-\\infty,\\infty]\\land a=\\sup\\{b\\in\\mathbb R:\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&lt;b\\})=0\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}infimum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialInfimum}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\Sigma)\\land a\\in[-\\infty,\\infty]\\land a=\\sup\\{b\\in\\mathbb R:\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&lt;b\\})=0\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}infimum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EssentialInfimum}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialInfimum}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,r)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}infimum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EssentialInfimum}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialInfimum}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,r)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The measure-space and measurability conditions are part of the definition, and the value is allowed to be an extended real.</li>\n<li>The measure7 name is an alias of the canonical predicate, so the variants cannot drift.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","i